.TH ALI-INFO 1 "October 2026" "ALI Linux 1.4.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ali-info \- ALI system report, for debugging and showing off
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ali-info
.RI [ \-\-share ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints OS, kernel, desktop, uptime, hardware, the ALI layer
(daemon states, dice ID, pending updates, blocked attackers, sea
state) and graphics. With
.B \-\-share
also writes ~/ali-info.txt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fastfetch (1),
.BR ali-sentinel (1)
